    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordelord</strong> is a hi-octane arena mobility shooter (horde &amp; endless modes) where you face waves of nasty enemies. Armed with powerful weapons and high-mobility skills, zip around and fight to achieve the highest score on global leaderboards. Hordelord sports tight gunplay, satisfying kills, and meaningful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horde Mode:</strong> Beat a finite number of increasingly difficult waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Try to survive for as long as possible against endless waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded for your playstyle by performing spectacular kills or hard-to-achieve feats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 punchy weapons, each with its own uses, tactics, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful alt-attacks for your weapons for even more carnage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Tarot Cards to gain various boosts and synergies to fit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zip around using multi-jump boots, spectral shovel, and various environmental jumpers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies, each with distinct strengths, weaknesses, and behaviors.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordelord</strong> is a hi-octane arena mobility shooter (horde &amp; endless modes) where you face waves of nasty enemies. Armed with powerful weapons and high-mobility skills, zip around and fight to achieve the highest score on global leaderboards. Hordelord sports tight gunplay, satisfying kills, and meaningful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horde Mode:</strong> Beat a finite number of increasingly difficult waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Try to survive for as long as possible against endless waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded for your playstyle by performing spectacular kills or hard-to-achieve feats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 punchy weapons, each with its own uses, tactics, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful alt-attacks for your weapons for even more carnage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Tarot Cards to gain various boosts and synergies to fit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zip around using multi-jump boots, spectral shovel, and various environmental jumpers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies, each with distinct strengths, weaknesses, and behaviors.</p></li></ul>",
